写在前面 我的虚拟机环境是Ubuntu 24.04.2 LTS 所以 以下shell均是在该环境写亲测有效 如果环境不一样 还请参考其他的内容 
参考链接： https://docs.docker.com/engine/install/ubuntu/

# Add Docker's official GPG key 
1.sudo apt-get update 
2.sudo apt-get install ca-certificates curl
3.sudo install -m 0755 -d /etc/apt/keyrings
4.sudo curl -fsSL https://download.docker.com/linux/ubuntu/gpg -o /etc/apt/keyrings/docker.asc  (说明 我在本地使用sudo执行的时候 报错，发现是不加sudo反而成功)
5.sudo chmod a+r /etc/apt/keyrings/docker.asc

# Add the repository to Apt sources:
1.echo "deb [arch=$(dpkg --print-architecture) signed-by=/etc/apt/keyrings/docker.asc] https://download.docker.com/linux/ubuntu $(. /etc/os-release && echo "$VERSION_CODENAME") stable" | sudo tee /etc/apt/sources.list.d/docker.list > /dev/null
2.sudo apt-get update
3.sudo apt-get install docker-ce docker-ce-cli containerd.io docker-buildx-plugin docker-compose-plugin

# docker version
1.docker version 
2.sysstemctl restart docker
3.sysstemctl start docker
4.sysstemctl stop docker


